The '''Talent Orb Castle''' is an animated [[Enemy Bases|Enemy Base]] found in the [[Ranking Dojo]]. It was added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Talent Orb Castle
|image = E 720.png
|appearance = [[Ranking Dojo]] - [[Arena of Destiny/Talent Tournament|Talent Tournament]]
|money drop = 0¢ - 0¢
}}

==Enemy==
It does nothing despite its special treatment as an animated base, basically acting as a regular base that can be hurt by [[Surge Attack]]s and [[Explosion]]s.

